  "question": {
    "text": "The minimum value of <math><mi>x</mi></math> which satisfies the inequality <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>λ</mi></math>, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;(use&nbsp;<math><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>1.41</mn></math>)",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "1.41",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/2fcd0710-403a-49a2-a9a5-4f017b7553da.png\" style=\"width:2.12014in;height:1.97361in\" /><br />Using the graphs of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></math> &amp; <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></math>, we can see that<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></math> for <math><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />So, the minimum value of <math><mi>x</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
